00:00:13.242 --> 00:00:15.241
the Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis

00:00:15.241 --> 00:00:17.832
so we're gonna be able to
talk a lot about the economy

00:00:17.832 --> 00:00:20.872
and Federal Reserve and
everything that's going on.

00:00:20.872 --> 00:00:21.705
Before we can jump into that

